data figure_3_buildup_progression_note: String = "Figure 3 panels a–e map to 2, 7, 209, 1004, and 6235 electrons. Panels 3a–3c appear completely random; pattern discernible only in 3d (1004 electrons); 3e clearly visible (6235)."
